  "solution_ref": "$f(3)=0$, $f(6)=0$, $f(x)=(x-3)(x-6)(x-k)$. $\\lim_{x\\to3}g=\\frac{3(6-k)}{-3(3-k)}=\\frac{6-k}{k-3}=3-1$ → $k=4$. $f(8)=40,\\ f(5)=-2$ → $g(5)=\\frac{40\\cdot(-1)}{-2}=20$",
